                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE ERROR-BUFFER TO EDIT-ERROR
                   MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (39) INDS (99)
                   PERFORM 69-READ-SCREEN
                   GO TO 621-CK-KEY-MODIFICATIONS
               ELSE
