           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
           MOVE ERROR-BUFFER TO EDIT-ERROR
           MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (43) INDS (99)
           PERFORM 69-READ-SCREEN
           GO TO 621-CK-KEY-MODIFICATIONS.

           IF WO-TIME-SCHD-P = "    " AND
              WO-DATE-SCHD-P NOT = "      "
                  MOVE 30017 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
                  PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                  MOVE ERROR-BUFFER TO EDIT-ERROR
                  MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (39) INDS (99)
                  PERFORM 69-READ-SCREEN
                  GO TO 621-CK-KEY-MODIFICATIONS.

           IF DATE-PROM-BUF-CN = DATE-RECD-BUF-CN AND
               WO-TIME-SCHD-P < WO-TIME-REC-P AND
      *------- ADDED THIS CONDITION SINCE THE PROGRAM NOW ACCEPTS SPACES
      *------- IF THE FIELD EQUALS SPACES, IT SHOULDN'T BE CONSIDERED A
      *------- TIME, AND THE ERROR MESSAGE SHOULD NOT PRINT.   04/19/1995
               WO-TIME-SCHD-P NOT EQUAL SPACES
                   MOVE 46016 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE ERROR-BUFFER TO EDIT-ERROR
                   MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (42) INDS (99)
                   PERFORM 69-READ-SCREEN
                   GO TO 621-CK-KEY-MODIFICATIONS.

